---
description: Component structure and organization standards
globs:
alwaysApply: agent
---

- Organize components using React functional components with hooks. Server Components for data fetching, Client Components (`'use client'`) only when interactivity is needed.
- Follow the ShadCN UI Composition pattern for all components.
- Use clear and descriptive naming for props, events, and methods.
- Keep logic within components focused and manageable.
- Add code comments for complex logic or non-obvious implementations.
- Use bracketed identifiers for logs: `[ComponentName]: message`.
